    nltl:evidenceExcerpt "Coefficients f_1-f_4 and g_1-g_3 are given in Table 3-3. C_3 = 460 kg/(m^2*s^2), C_4 = 18.7 kg/(m^2*s^2), C_5 = 825 kg/s^2. If the value of the term ((L*T)/B^2)^3 is less than 5, the value 5 shall be used; if the value is more than 20, the value 20 shall be used." ;
